# LoC MARC country code → YSO bridge with multilingual labels.
#
# Per docs/bffi_limitations.md L-12, neither LoC's countries vocabulary
# nor YSO publishes a cross-reference between
# <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/countries/{code}> and the corresponding
# YSO concept. This file is our own bridge: one skos:exactMatch into
# main YSO plus inlined fi/sv/en prefLabels (cached from YSO at the
# time this file was written, so it stays useful even when Fuseki is
# offline at Skosify time).
#
# Coverage: every LoC MARC country code observed in the Helmet
# 500-sample as of 2026-06-09 (21 codes) plus a generous "common
# countries" set seeded from YSO. Extend by adding more rows as
# missing codes surface in a run — the
# `_synthesise_country_labels` Skosify pass is data-driven; no code
# change needed.
#
# Per-code research source: LoC MARC country code list
# (https://www.loc.gov/marc/countries/cou_home.html — codes are
# 2-3 chars, not ISO 3166); YSO concept URI + prefLabels via the
# loaded `<http://www.yso.fi/onto/yso/>` Fuseki graph.
#
# License: CC0 (this bridge is our own contribution; YSO labels are
# Finto-curated under their own CC0 release).

@prefix bridge: <http://urn.fi/URN:NBN:fi:bib:bridge/loc-countries/> .
@prefix loc:    <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/countries/> .
@prefix owl:    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix yso:    <http://www.yso.fi/onto/yso/> .

# === Bridge graph identifier ===

bridge: a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "Local LoC MARC country code ↔ YSO bridge"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Project-owned bridge — see docs/bffi_limitations.md L-12."@en .

# === Countries observed in the 500-record sample ===

loc:ch  skos:exactMatch yso:p104984 ;
        skos:prefLabel  "Kiina"@fi, "Kina"@sv, "China"@en ;
        skos:notation   "ch" .

loc:dk  skos:exactMatch yso:p94439 ;
        skos:prefLabel  "Tanska"@fi, "Danmark"@sv, "Denmark"@en ;
        skos:notation   "dk" .

